Script: aur-helper-shell (v2)
Description: Search, inspect, audit, build, install and upgrade AUR packages
             on Arch Linux, with recursive AUR dependency resolution,
             PKGBUILD review/diff, a quick security audit, fzf interactive
             mode, API caching, history log and shell completion.
Usage: ./aur-helper-shell [options] <command | term>
Requires: pacman, git, jq, curl (or wget), base-devel. Optional: fzf, column.
DOCUMENTATION

